        "created_at": "2020-12-16T22:16:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, with what limited free&nbsp;time I have, I decided it would be fun to&nbsp;start converting Heroes from Sentinels of the Multiverse decks to SCRPG character sheets, guessing at what their charecteristics would be. Obviously, I am only converting the ones not released yet, or the ones that never will be released (&lt;cough&gt; Nightmist, Scholar, Ra &lt;cough&gt;).</p>\n<p>So, my question is: will I be allowed to share these conversions on these&nbsp;Forums&nbsp;(once I'm done with them)?</p>\n<p>I understand that it could disallowed, as it is essential giving out a (<em>much lower quality</em>) version of&nbsp;future products for free.&nbsp;So&nbsp;I wanted to ask before sharing.</p>\n<p>Well, yay or nay?</p>",
